(Behind-the-Scenes 17)

575
00:22:08,340 --> 00:22:10,000
(Behind-the-Scenes)

576
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,660
(After rowing)

577
00:22:12,910 --> 00:22:13,710
And then...

578
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:14,510
Bye bye.

579
00:22:15,140 --> 00:22:15,940
You're leaving.

580
00:22:16,180 --> 00:22:17,740
(Immediately gets up)

581
00:22:20,420 --> 00:22:21,460
(Grabs)

582
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:22,620
(Glances)

583
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:23,860
What should I do?

584
00:22:23,860 --> 00:22:24,820
Jump over?

585
00:22:25,140 --> 00:22:26,100
Jump over.

586
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:27,620
(Reaches out)

587
00:22:43,660 --> 00:22:45,500
Two of us...

588
00:22:47,350 --> 00:22:47,820
Are you alright?

589
00:22:47,820 --> 00:22:48,860
I'm fine.

590
00:22:49,710 --> 00:22:50,430
Take this off.

591
00:22:50,430 --> 00:22:50,910
Okay.

592
00:22:52,300 --> 00:22:53,940
(Takes it)

593
00:22:55,980 --> 00:22:56,780
Alright.

594
00:22:57,220 --> 00:22:58,020
Let's go.

595
00:22:59,630 --> 00:23:02,230
My upper lip feels like

596
00:23:02,230 --> 00:23:04,110
it's become a figurine.

597
00:23:05,020 --> 00:23:05,660
(Points)

598
00:23:10,230 --> 00:23:11,070
It's quite...

599
00:23:12,460 --> 00:23:13,620
Really?

600
00:23:13,620 --> 00:23:17,300
I'm curious what I look like now.

601
00:23:17,780 --> 00:23:19,220
Go back and rest.

602
00:23:21,670 --> 00:23:24,620
I'll take it. It's heavy.

603
00:23:24,620 --> 00:23:25,180
(Takes it)

604
00:23:25,180 --> 00:23:25,700
Thank you.

605
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:29,390
We didn't enter the stargazing room,

606
00:23:29,390 --> 00:23:31,590
but it felt like we did.

607
00:23:35,700 --> 00:23:40,660
(Behind-the-Scenes 18)

608
00:23:41,310 --> 00:23:42,710
(Behind-the-Scenes)
Does this smell nice?

609
00:23:44,150 --> 00:23:45,230
(Asks)
Do you usually use essential oils?

610
00:23:46,780 --> 00:23:48,060
Yeah. Before I sleep.

611
00:23:48,060 --> 00:23:49,540
Do you have it in the dorm?

612
00:23:50,060 --> 00:23:50,740
Do you?

613
00:23:50,740 --> 00:23:51,990
You mean upstairs?

614
00:23:51,990 --> 00:23:52,550
No.

615
00:23:52,550 --> 00:23:54,270
(Curious)
What smells do you like?

616
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:55,340
Woody tones?

617
00:23:55,340 --> 00:23:57,220
I'm okay with anything.

618
00:23:58,180 --> 00:24:00,500
Does it help with sleep?

619
00:24:00,500 --> 00:24:03,350
I've tried it before.

620
00:24:05,710 --> 00:24:07,460
I tried using mentholated oil.

621
00:24:07,780 --> 00:24:08,940
Sprinkled it on the floor

622
00:24:08,980 --> 00:24:09,940
(Moves closer)
during the summer.

623
00:24:10,830 --> 00:24:11,830
During the summer.

624
00:24:11,830 --> 00:24:12,980
Super calming.

625
00:24:12,980 --> 00:24:13,500
Really?

626
00:24:13,500 --> 00:24:14,140
Yes.

627
00:24:16,780 --> 00:24:18,300
Well, my sleep quality is super good.

628
00:24:18,300 --> 00:24:19,510
I fall asleep as soon as I hit the bed.

629
00:24:20,180 --> 00:24:21,020
I used to...

630
00:24:21,020 --> 00:24:21,980
I don't need to calm down.

631
00:24:22,820 --> 00:24:23,790
I don't need to calm down.

632
00:24:26,380 --> 00:24:27,660
I used to have severe insomnia.

633
00:24:28,220 --> 00:24:29,020
Why?

634
00:24:30,380 --> 00:24:32,100
I suppose

635
00:24:32,100 --> 00:24:33,790
I had a lot on my mind.

636
00:24:33,790 --> 00:24:37,780
I was partnering with others

637
00:24:37,780 --> 00:24:38,940
(Nods)
and working.

638
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:40,740
A phone call

639
00:24:40,740 --> 00:24:42,030
might come in anytime.

640
00:24:42,030 --> 00:24:43,550
I was quite anxious

641
00:24:43,550 --> 00:24:45,150
and had insomnia then.

642
00:24:45,470 --> 00:24:46,220
But

643
00:24:46,220 --> 00:24:46,820
after that...

644
00:24:48,060 --> 00:24:49,380
Things got better after you came out.

645
00:24:49,380 --> 00:24:50,700
Yeah. It got better after working alone.

646
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:52,060
I slept better.

647
00:24:52,710 --> 00:24:53,990
That's good.

648
00:25:03,740 --> 00:25:08,700
(Behind-the-Scenes 19)

649
00:25:08,740 --> 00:25:09,780
(Behind-the-Scenes)

650
00:25:09,780 --> 00:25:11,470
I've been talking to Sun Bohan every day.

651
00:25:13,390 --> 00:25:15,230
I talk to Kaiyi a lot too.

652
00:25:15,230 --> 00:25:17,990
Kaiyi feels like
a vey optimistic person.

653
00:25:19,390 --> 00:25:20,870
She's quite nice.

654
00:25:23,740 --> 00:25:25,980
I feel like I used
to be a bit like that.

655
00:25:27,780 --> 00:25:28,940
So you're anxious now.

656
00:25:28,940 --> 00:25:30,660
You think about things repeatedly

657
00:25:31,020 --> 00:25:31,900
and weigh them.

658
00:25:32,980 --> 00:25:33,980
I admit.

659
00:25:35,580 --> 00:25:38,220
I do have a lot of thoughts.

660
00:25:41,430 --> 00:25:43,190
As for me, I live in the present,

661
00:25:43,190 --> 00:25:44,470
or maybe I focus on feelings.

662
00:25:44,470 --> 00:25:46,500
This isn't something

663
00:25:46,500 --> 00:25:47,820
I expect of myself.

664
00:25:47,820 --> 00:25:48,940
And the things I tell you.

665
00:25:48,940 --> 00:25:49,460
Actually,

666
00:25:49,460 --> 00:25:51,510
I think about them when I get back.

667
00:25:51,510 --> 00:25:52,310
I ponder on them in my room.

668
00:25:52,310 --> 00:25:53,510
I realized that a lot
of the things I tell you

669
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,790
were things I was telling myself too.

670
00:25:56,740 --> 00:25:57,540
Understand.

671
00:25:58,980 --> 00:26:01,620
I can't feel and live in the present,

672
00:26:01,620 --> 00:26:02,780
so I keep emphasizing it.

673
00:26:04,310 --> 00:26:05,950
So it's not that...

674
00:26:06,940 --> 00:26:08,620
This is so tough.

675
00:26:08,620 --> 00:26:09,700
It's not that complicated.

676
00:26:09,700 --> 00:26:10,670
Just be happy.

677
00:26:10,670 --> 00:26:12,310
Like how comfortable I am lying here.

678
00:26:15,020 --> 00:26:16,220
Me too.

679
00:26:17,190 --> 00:26:18,190
Then that's enough.

680
00:26:22,700 --> 00:26:27,660
(Behind-the-Scenes 20)

681
00:26:27,700 --> 00:26:30,500
(Behind-the-Scenes)

682
00:26:30,500 --> 00:26:31,220
What's wrong?

683
00:26:31,700 --> 00:26:32,260
What's wrong?

684
00:26:32,260 --> 00:26:33,820
Nothing. I'm waiting for her.

685
00:26:34,380 --> 00:26:35,420
Me too.

686
00:26:35,420 --> 00:26:36,900
Let's sit on the massage chair.

687
00:26:39,190 --> 00:26:40,510
I'll grab a blanket.

688
00:26:41,270 --> 00:26:42,070
Okay.

689
00:26:52,820 --> 00:26:54,580
(Brings a blanket)

690
00:27:00,910 --> 00:27:02,710
But it's so hot today.

691
00:27:02,710 --> 00:27:03,510
(Finds a topic)
Yeah.

692
00:27:10,100 --> 00:27:11,300
(Feeling awkward)

693
00:27:17,820 --> 00:27:18,740
(Glances)

694
00:27:25,710 --> 00:27:26,590
It's time to submit.

695
00:27:29,190 --> 00:27:31,190
So, where's Liang Renfang?

696
00:27:31,980 --> 00:27:32,900
I'm waiting for her.

697
00:27:32,900 --> 00:27:35,580
She's packing her stuff.

698
00:27:36,660 --> 00:27:38,260
Alright. We're going to the study.

699
00:27:38,260 --> 00:27:38,630
Okay.

700
00:27:38,630 --> 00:27:39,990
I have a thesis to write.

701
00:27:40,670 --> 00:27:41,230
Bye.

702
00:27:41,230 --> 00:27:42,350
The kitchen?

703
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:43,830
Writing a thesis in the kitchen?

704
00:27:45,950 --> 00:27:46,980
The study.

705
00:27:46,980 --> 00:27:48,140
Not kitchen.

706
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:52,270
I was wondering
why you loved the kitchen so much.

707
00:27:55,140 --> 00:27:57,140
(Continues to wait)

708
00:27:58,860 --> 00:28:03,820
(Behind-the-Scenes 21)

709
00:28:03,860 --> 00:28:04,980
(Behind-the-Scenes)

710
00:28:04,980 --> 00:28:05,910
I'll take a picture of you.

711
00:28:06,550 --> 00:28:07,140
Thank you.

712
00:28:07,140 --> 00:28:08,420
You look beautiful here.

713
00:28:08,420 --> 00:28:09,180
Thanks.

714
00:28:09,340 --> 00:28:10,300
I'll use that angle.

715
00:28:10,300 --> 00:28:11,180
You look beautiful

716
00:28:11,180 --> 00:28:12,220
from above.

717
00:28:13,550 --> 00:28:14,270
So gorgeous.

718
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:16,950
Hang on. Let me see.

719
00:28:16,950 --> 00:28:18,110
Please take my left profile. Thanks.

720
00:28:18,230 --> 00:28:19,710
Left profile. Here?

721
00:28:20,220 --> 00:28:20,940
Yes.

722
00:28:20,940 --> 00:28:21,740
Thank you.

723
00:28:23,380 --> 00:28:24,540
How do you want it?

724
00:28:24,820 --> 00:28:26,180
(Looking for the right angle)

725
00:28:27,630 --> 00:28:28,980
There's a red pillar behind you.

726
00:28:28,980 --> 00:28:30,180
I'll come down.

727
00:28:31,220 --> 00:28:32,580
I'll enjoy myself here then.

728
00:28:33,260 --> 00:28:34,460
Go ahead.

729
00:28:34,460 --> 00:28:35,430
I'll enjoy myself.

730
00:28:44,110 --> 00:28:45,470
Do you want to give me a little...

731
00:28:46,860 --> 00:28:47,500
What?

732
00:28:47,500 --> 00:28:48,910
Anything. You can play the piano.

733
00:28:49,940 --> 00:28:50,700
(Flips hair)

734
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:51,180
Three.

735
00:28:51,180 --> 00:28:51,660
Look at me.

736
00:28:51,660 --> 00:28:52,380
Three, two.

737
00:28:52,380 --> 00:28:53,060
Look at you?

738
00:28:53,060 --> 00:28:53,660
Anything.

739
00:28:53,660 --> 00:28:54,630
No. I'm too shy to look at you.

740
00:28:54,630 --> 00:28:55,860
I pressed the button. I'm so nervous.

741
00:28:55,860 --> 00:28:56,100
Okay.

742
00:28:56,100 --> 00:28:56,820
It's fine. It's a test shot.

743
00:29:00,100 --> 00:29:00,900
So pretty.

744
00:29:01,110 --> 00:29:02,190
You took a great shot.

745
00:29:02,420 --> 00:29:07,380
(Behind-the-Scenes 22)

746
00:29:07,620 --> 00:29:08,820
(Behind-the-Scenes)
Fruits, anyone?

747
00:29:09,060 --> 00:29:09,860
Sure.

748
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:11,510
Let's see what fruits we have here.

749
00:29:13,620 --> 00:29:14,860
You're so nice.

750
00:29:14,860 --> 00:29:15,980
This is the leftover cut fruit, right?

751
00:29:15,980 --> 00:29:17,100
I think so.

752
00:29:18,070 --> 00:29:19,340
I love you.

753
00:29:19,340 --> 00:29:21,270
You're actually not hanging out
with Cao Yiheng

754
00:29:21,270 --> 00:29:22,390
but with me instead.

755
00:29:23,700 --> 00:29:24,700
I'm so happy.

756
00:29:24,700 --> 00:29:25,710
Of course.

757
00:29:26,390 --> 00:29:28,470
It's because I love you.

758
00:29:29,100 --> 00:29:30,660
(Smiles)

759
00:29:31,230 --> 00:29:32,070
Hello.

760
00:29:33,390 --> 00:29:34,390
Do you want to eat?

761
00:29:34,390 --> 00:29:35,270
She's hungry again.

762
00:29:35,940 --> 00:29:37,540
Let's make something to eat.

763
00:29:37,910 --> 00:29:38,870
You two can eat.

764
00:29:38,870 --> 00:29:40,110
I'll wash some fruits.

765
00:29:40,350 --> 00:29:41,470
We need to wash some fruits, right?

766
00:29:42,270 --> 00:29:43,820
Okay, you can demonstrate.

767
00:29:43,820 --> 00:29:45,060
You do the honors.

768
00:29:49,470 --> 00:29:50,870
I'll give this to you.

769
00:29:52,700 --> 00:29:53,740
(Mosquito repellent band)
The yellow one.

770
00:29:54,300 --> 00:29:55,100
(Leans)

771
00:29:55,100 --> 00:29:55,620
Okay.

772
00:30:00,700 --> 00:30:02,180
(Checking both out)

773
00:30:02,180 --> 00:30:03,550
I'm sneaking a peach.

774
00:30:03,550 --> 00:30:04,020
Go ahead.

775
00:30:04,020 --> 00:30:04,780
Okay.

776
00:30:04,780 --> 00:30:05,940
You two can heat up the dishes.

777
00:30:07,790 --> 00:30:08,590
Are you eating?

778
00:30:09,710 --> 00:30:10,510
I can heat it up for you.

779
00:30:11,990 --> 00:30:13,470
(Changing his mind)
I can eat with you.

780
00:30:18,190 --> 00:30:20,430
I think these strawberries are alright.

781
00:30:20,870 --> 00:30:22,260
I'll pick the best one for you.

782
00:30:22,260 --> 00:30:23,180
Okay.

783
00:30:23,460 --> 00:30:24,860
(Plucks)

784
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,070
Any other fruit you'd like to eat?

785
00:30:30,070 --> 00:30:31,510
Let me think about it.

786
00:30:31,510 --> 00:30:32,350
(Hands over)
Eat a strawberry.

787
00:30:32,350 --> 00:30:33,230
Thank you.

788
00:30:33,980 --> 00:30:34,740
This is for you.

789
00:30:35,540 --> 00:30:36,460
You take one too.

790
00:30:36,460 --> 00:30:37,420
I'll just have one for now.

791
00:30:40,540 --> 00:30:41,300
Is it sweet?

792
00:30:41,620 --> 00:30:42,100
Yes.

793
00:30:43,220 --> 00:30:44,340
(Smiles)

794
00:30:45,100 --> 00:30:46,340
I'll put some in a small bowl for you.

795
00:30:46,340 --> 00:30:47,220
Thank you.

796
00:30:50,900 --> 00:30:51,860
I like mushrooms.

797
00:30:52,390 --> 00:30:53,230
I'll pick them out.

798
00:30:54,900 --> 00:30:56,020
There are two mushrooms here.

799
00:30:56,180 --> 00:30:57,020
That's enough.

800
00:30:57,100 --> 00:30:58,100
No.

801
00:30:58,180 --> 00:30:58,940
(Smiles)

802
00:30:58,940 --> 00:31:00,540
You have to eat more of it then.

803
00:31:00,540 --> 00:31:01,710
Yeah. That's why I said it's not enough

804
00:31:01,710 --> 00:31:02,710
because I'm eating too.

805
00:31:03,110 --> 00:31:04,220
Didn't you say you were full?

806
00:31:04,220 --> 00:31:05,340
I said I'll eat with you.

807
00:31:05,340 --> 00:31:06,260
I'm afraid you'll feel guilty.

808
00:31:11,220 --> 00:31:12,820
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=

809
00:31:12,820 --> 00:31:14,460
(SVIP updates every Mon & Tue at noon)

810
00:31:14,460 --> 00:31:15,980
(VIP updates every Tue & Wed
at noon, one week early)
